<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $65-3/8 (FIM 324.20).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $65-3/8 (FIM 324.20).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR</p>
<p>closed down $1-3/8 at $65-3/8 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 324.20 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Tuesday, Nokia A closed down 0.50 markka at</p>
<p>324.00 markka.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed flat at</p>
<p>$36 on Wall Street. The price equals about 89.30 markka. In</p>
<p>Helsinki, Valmet closed up 0.20 markka at 89.50.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR ended $0-3/8 higher at $22-1/4</p>
<p>in New York on Tuesday. The price equals about 110.40 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Tuesday, Rauma closed down 1.50 markka at</p>
<p>108.50.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 235</p>
</text>
